#
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Interface:  VSC8540_RGMII
#
# Purpose:    Creates timing reports for ports on interfaces.  These reports
#             can be analyzed by the sta-constraints-validator (stacv).  Each
#             analyzed port on the interface will have setup and hold reports
#             for each corner. Each port will have its own file.
#
# Requires:   PROJ_DIR
